abstract: "Test cases with exact expected outputs for Arabic text normalisation under six named policies (identity, nfc, nfkc, raw-safe-v1, bayanat-norm-v1, asr-eval-v1), a runner with adapters for several normalisers, and a conformance matrix. Cases and documentation CC BY 4.0; code Apache-2.0."
